, triggering an immediate win for my team. There is no reason to pass, as doing so would miss a guaranteed victory.\n\nReason: I have only one card left (♠2). Playing it beats the current card (♣9) and empties my hand, resulting in an immediate win for the Peasant team.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠2"]}'}
